[
{
"k": "15585",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You can help me."
},
{
"k": "15586",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There's a woman who needs us."
},
{
"k": "15587",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This is very imporant."
},
{
"k": "15588",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This is very important. I need you to tell me what you saw."
},
{
"k": "15589",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You found a lady, remember?"
},
{
"k": "15590",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What time was it?"
},
{
"k": "15591",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Tell me all about it."
},
{
"k": "15592",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What were you doing when you saw her?"
},
{
"k": "15593",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Are you going to make us go to The Farm?"
},
{
"k": "15594",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "We're helping him do his job!"
},
{
"k": "15595",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That means he owes us a favor."
},
{
"k": "15596",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Oh, no, it's OK, son."
},
{
"k": "15597",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "The Sheriff wouldn't do that."
},
{
"k": "15598",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I don't want us to have to go there."
},
{
"k": "15599",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Are you going to make us go to The Farm"
},
{
"k": "15600",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Nobody said that."
},
{
"k": "15601",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You're not  in trouble."
},
{
"k": "15602",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You won't have to go to the Farm."
},
{
"k": "15603",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I really need you to tell me."
},
{
"k": "15604",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's OK, you're not in trouble."
},
{
"k": "15605",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Promise we don't have to go to the Farm?"
},
{
"k": "15606",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Promise"
},
{
"k": "15607",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Don't promise"
},
{
"k": "15608",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There, you see? Everything's fine. Now tell the nice man what you were doing."
},
{
"k": "15609",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Yes, I promise. You don't have to go to the Farm."
},
{
"k": "15610",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Well, I was swimming. In the river near where we live. My dad lets me go at night if I want to."
},
{
"k": "15611",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "The river-- that's interesting."
},
{
"k": "15612",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[to snow]Woodsman did say he'd thrown her there…\n(sub-conditional if Snow caught you torturing the Woodsman)"
},
{
"k": "15613",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Was anyone with you?"
},
{
"k": "15614",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Did you have a glamour on?"
},
{
"k": "15615",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Then what happened?"
},
{
"k": "15616",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[to toad]You let him swim in the East River, alone, at night?"
},
{
"k": "15617",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Were you by yourself, or was someone with you?"
},
{
"k": "15618",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Night's best, he won't be seen then."
},
{
"k": "15619",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "By myself."
},
{
"k": "15620",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I know, but we're amphibians. It's our nature. I wouldn't expect you to understand."
},
{
"k": "15621",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You're right, I don't."
},
{
"k": "15622",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You'd be surprised."
},
{
"k": "15623",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Whether I understand is unimportant."
},
{
"k": "15624",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You might be surprised by what I understand."
},
{
"k": "15625",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Where in the river were you?"
},
{
"k": "15626",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Did you see anyone around?"
},
{
"k": "15627",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How did you find the body?"
},
{
"k": "15628",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "By the edge. My dad doesn't like me to go far out."
},
{
"k": "15629",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I heard a big splash, so I swam over to the side to see what it was. I didn't know if it was a person at first, because they didn't have a head."
},
{
"k": "15630",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How did you find the woman who was in the water?"
},
{
"k": "15631",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Does that tell you something?"
},
{
"k": "15632",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Hm. Shallow water, straight off the bank with no boat…"
},
{
"k": "15633",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Bold."
},
{
"k": "15634",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Amateur."
},
{
"k": "15635",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Unplanned."
},
{
"k": "15636",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Meant to be found."
},
{
"k": "15637",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "My take would be we're dealing with somebody who doesn't know much about dumping a body."
},
{
"k": "15638",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Well… I guess that's better than the alternative."
},
{
"k": "15639",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "A troll."
},
{
"k": "15640",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "They look better on you. She's more of an autumn."
},
{
"k": "15641",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[showing the picture and the box in opposite hands]I guess I broke the spell?"
},
{
"k": "15642",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[fascinated]Whoa!"
},
{
"k": "15643",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "But… she's still wearing my clothes."
},
{
"k": "15644",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Oh, no!"
},
{
"k": "15645",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Miss White?"
},
{
"k": "15646",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That's just like my box."
},
{
"k": "15647",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This is bad."
},
{
"k": "15648",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You can't. Once it's done it's done. Trust me, I know."
},
{
"k": "15649",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Uh oh, this is bad."
},
{
"k": "15650",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not exactly familiar territory here, but, yeah, probably?  If not now then soon?"
},
{
"k": "15651",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "The mundys! They have… the rest of her!"
},
{
"k": "15652",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[confirming more than asking]Her head is going to look like a troll now, too?"
},
{
"k": "15653",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "So… No choice. We've got to break into the police station and get it back."
},
{
"k": "15654",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Before they see it."
},
{
"k": "15655",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How much do we know?"
},
{
"k": "15656",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "As soon as possible."
},
{
"k": "15657",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "VERY good."
},
{
"k": "15658",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Their security is very good."
},
{
"k": "15659",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's locked up in the morgue."
},
{
"k": "15660",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Only Brannigan can access it."
},
{
"k": "15661",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Forensics is coming in a few hours."
},
{
"k": "15662",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "While I was at the station I overheard them say the forensics experts were delayed, so we've got a few hours to work with before anybody sees it."
},
{
"k": "15663",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "To do what?"
},
{
"k": "15664",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How are we ever going to keep this quiet?"
},
{
"k": "15665",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "We can't just walk in the front door."
},
{
"k": "15666",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There are police everywhere, cameras, alarms…"
},
{
"k": "15667",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Back door, then?"
},
{
"k": "15668",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I could force my way in."
},
{
"k": "15669",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I could go in disguise."
},
{
"k": "15670",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Only Brannigan can access the morgue."
},
{
"k": "15671",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This would be easier if I looked like her. Can we get a fresh glamour from the witches?"
},
{
"k": "15672",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I couldn't possibly authorize the expenditure."
},
{
"k": "15673",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Even if I liked the idea, it takes a week for them to make a glamour from scratch. We would need something ready to go."
},
{
"k": "15674",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Unfortunately I don't know of any sources for quick glamours, do you?"
},
{
"k": "15675",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I have my doubts about that. This calls for a cool head."
},
{
"k": "15676",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "He's right about the glamour; I don't care for it but it would help a lot if we could get one."
},
{
"k": "15677",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Well, I am open to suggestions."
},
{
"k": "15678",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Could we destroy the police station, and the evidence with it?"
},
{
"k": "15679",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Possibly. That's pretty extreme, though, isn't it? I think we should give Bigby a shot at infiltrating before we take that kind of action."
},
{
"k": "15680",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I can handle this."
},
{
"k": "15681",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Let's not do anything drastic."
},
{
"k": "15682",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Maybe. I don't know. Using one would simplify things."
},
{
"k": "15683",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Well."
},
{
"k": "15684",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Without a glamour?"
},
{
"k": "15685",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'm open to suggestions."
},
{
"k": "15686",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I could try the direct approach; force my way in there."
},
{
"k": "15687",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What about all those guns they have? You don't want to take mundy weapons lightly."
},
{
"k": "15688",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "And it's just the sort of scene we're trying to avoid."
},
{
"k": "15689",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What have you got against the witches?"
},
{
"k": "15690",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What bothers you about using a glamour?"
},
{
"k": "15691",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There must be somewhere else we can get a glamour"
},
{
"k": "15692",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Any other ideas?"
},
{
"k": "15693",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Is there something that bothers you about the idea of using a glamour to sneak into the morgue?"
},
{
"k": "15694",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I realize it's a good plan. It's just…[looking over at the troll] pretending to be someone else, someone who actually exists, isn't a thing we should take lightly."
},
{
"k": "15695",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I see your point."
},
{
"k": "15696",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Sure you don't know anywhere to get a glamour?"
},
{
"k": "15697",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Could Bluebeard get us a glamour?"
},
{
"k": "15698",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What do you think we should be doing?"
},
{
"k": "15699",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Are you sure you don't know of somewhere else we could get a glamour?"
},
{
"k": "15700",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What would I know about that? I don't have any trouble blending in."
},
{
"k": "15701",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I doubt it. He's as normal as you or-- he's as normal as Miss White or I."
},
{
"k": "15702",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Do you think your pal Bluebeard would know where to find a glamour quickly? He's a crafty guy."
},
{
"k": "15703",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I think we leave nothing to chance. Destroy the evidence and anything else we have to. Put this body down the Witching Well right away, and keep it all between the people in this room."
},
{
"k": "15704",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How do you think we should be handling this?"
},
{
"k": "15705",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Can we use the glamour from the troll?"
},
{
"k": "15706",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Do you have a glamour we can use?"
},
{
"k": "15707",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Do you have a glamour lined up for your son (that we could use)?"
},
{
"k": "15708",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I need to meet your source."
},
{
"k": "15709",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I need you to do something for me. I want to meet whoever you got your glamour from yesterday."
},
{
"k": "15710",
"who": "CUT TO",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "The Trip Trap, for the scene with Jack."
},
{
"k": "15711",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Consider it your civic duty. I need to meet him. Now."
},
{
"k": "15712",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Look, I know what I said then, but he's not going to like me bringing the law around."
},
{
"k": "15713",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Christ."
},
{
"k": "15714",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Yes?"
},
{
"k": "15715",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I might know someone."
},
{
"k": "15716",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[clears his throat]"
},
{
"k": "15717",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Well?"
},
{
"k": "15718",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Well, it's just that, um… if it's a glamour you're looking for, on the quick…"
},
{
"k": "15719",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Yes. I thought of that."
},
{
"k": "15720",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It would be foolish to ignore the possibility."
},
{
"k": "15721",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Have there been threats?"
},
{
"k": "15722",
"who": "",
