"en": "- Start the scene with Toad Jr. convo - informed / contrasted with the torture that came moments before.\n\n- Toads are told to stick around while you examine the body.  Toad takes TJ to some other (unseen) part of the environment, to \"play\".\n\n- When YOU fuck up the glamour, the Toads come to gape at the Troll, drawn by the hubbub.  (brief moment where you register their presence).\n\n- Then, we have the argument between Crane and Snow about what to do.  Crane wants extreme measures, he's spooked.\n\n- You can move the argument quickly toward solution by weighing in.  Regardless, it ends up on fulcrum of \"can't get a glamour fast enough\", and you get reticle control.  \n\n- You gotta click Toad to shut up Crane and Snow with your brilliant idea.  (Or, fail, and Snow will eventually come up with it herself.)"
